<p>We tested the Ollagraph E-commerce Extraction pipeline against 200 e-commerce product pages across 10 platforms: Shopify (50), Magento (40), WooCommerce (35), BigCommerce (25), Salesforce Commerce Cloud (20), custom React storefronts (15), Vue-based stores (10), and others (5).</p>

